  "title": "BuzzFeed, Inc. Reports Q4 and Full Year 2025 Results",
  "summary": "NEW YORK --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Mar. 12, 2026-- BuzzFeed, Inc.’s (“BuzzFeed” or the “Company”) (Nasdaq: BZFD) fourth quarter and full year (ended December 31, 2025) financial results were in line with its outlook shared in November. In 2025, BuzzFeed grew programmatic advertising by 7% year over year,",
